A GNOME app (GTK 4, libadwaita) that makes an Amiga UNIX (AMIX) disk for one
machine from your own AMIX 2.1c core system: a core HDF, a tape image with
its root floppy, or a running AMIX system.  It adds the kernel, drivers,
desktop and tools from amix-userland and amix-gate that fit the machine,
links the chosen cards' drivers into your own kernel, writes the pvmk boot
disk and an FS-UAE configuration.  It never ships Commodore's files.
